{"version": 1, "engine": "f1a2225a9917afb03638bbf6be640366df18ac95fd9ae20138c21ed54e0cd49a", "lane": "local", "mode": "shadow", "status": "working", "started_at": "2026-09-17T23:45:36.808542+00:00", "expires_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+03:00", "audit": [{"event": "started", "at": "2026-09-17T23:45:36.808576+00:00"}, {"event": "selected", "at": "2026-09-17T23:45:56.540670+00:00"}, {"event": "researched", "at": "2026-09-17T23:46:08.578144+00:00"}, {"event": "drafted", "at": "2026-09-17T23:46:27.721802+00:00"}, {"event": "repair_required", "at": "2026-09-17T23:46:52.412708+00:00", "feedback": "unknown_visual_selection: dates fruit varieties: Card1: chose a clear date-palm tree landscape photo matching the general palm species topic. Card2: no true ancient-palm photos existed, so I used the cuneiform tablet documenting a date-palm orchard purchase, the closest thematic match to ancient palm cultivation, avoiding unrelated Egyptian gold/column artifacts. Card3: selected the tall palm trees against blue sky image, best depicting height as described. Card4: selected the old grey palm tree roots close-up, directly evoking an aged palm tree; other options (historic 1889 photo, sunset/boulevard shots) don't convey age. Card5: all provided options were botanical illustrations of coconut and starfruit, unrelated to date fruit shape/color, so no suitable image exists \u2014 returned null. Card6: chose the ripe and dry dates bunches photo, wh"}, {"event": "drafted", "at": "2026-09-17T23:47:14.413280+00:00"}, {"event": "repair_required", "at": "2026-09-17T23:47:43.065925+00:00", "feedback": "unknown_visual_selection: date fruit shape: \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0642\u06291: \u0635\u0648\u0631\u0629 \u0646\u062e\u0644\u0629 \u062a\u0645\u0631 \u0639\u0627\u0645\u0629 \u0628\u0645\u0646\u0638\u0631 \u0637\u0628\u064a\u0639\u064a\u060c \u062a\u0645\u062b\u064a\u0644 \u0645\u0646\u0627\u0633\u0628 \u0644\u062c\u0646\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u062e\u064a\u0644. \u0627\u0644\u0628\u06